{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2022-11-28 10:57:00', 'title': 'COMED EXPLORES BATTERY ENERGY STORAGE TO IMPROVE RESILIENCY FOR CUSTOMERS IN NORTHERN ILLINOIS', 'text': 'CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COMED IS EXPLORING NEW BATTERY ENERGY STORAGE SYSTEM (BESS) SOLUTIONS THAT IMPROVE RESILIENCY BY LIMITING THE IMPACT OF POWER OUTAGES FOR CUSTOMERS IN THIS NEW TECHNOLOGY DEMONSTRATION, COMED IS EVALUATING THE EFFECTIVENESS OF LOCALIZED BATTERIES TO SUPPORT SELECT CUSTOMERS WHO LIVE IN STREATOR, ILL., LOSTANT, ILL., AND MILLEDGEVILLE, ILL.'}